ower: SE per cell reported\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-050\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-PAP-034", "score": 0.105, "document": "# FAM:SF-PAP-034 | Study family SF-PAP-034: Position breakdown and Gobert sanity check on structural load\n- observed_research_question: Position breakdown and Gobert sanity check on structural load\n- auto_outcome_status: no result recorded\n- observed_hypothesis: Structural load is not an artifact of position or low initiation volume (Gobert vs other C/F-C; init<400 vs >=400).\n- observed_result: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: no result CSV/log of the printed tables was found\n- observed_sample_and_power: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Exploratory merge of fragility_full_loads with player_positions and initiation totals from paper2_full_edges.parquet.\n- observed_verdict: abandoned\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: Archive paper discusses Gobert as a low-usage hub but does not report this script's group means.\n- auto_confidence: low (0.15)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-155"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-015", "score": 0.09, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-015 | Study family SF-APPS-015: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- observed_research_question: Player BEST/AVOID tier tendency in H2 trigger games (55 series)\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Teams and players differ in how often H2 trigger possessions land on the engine's BEST vs AVOID counter.\n- observed_result: Team AVOID% ranges 50.6% (ORL) to 6.8% (SAC); team BEST% 0.0%-15.8%.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: No outcome test; player samples 10-178 possessions.\n- observed_sample_and_power: min 10 poss per player\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-048\n- observed_method: trigger_table_clean.csv, 55 series 2022-2026, 179 players, 25 teams, min 10 poss.\n- observed_verdict: descriptive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-001"}], "n_results": 4}

